---
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
---
<Diagram caption="The replacement is proven while the old DC is still online. The name is new because the server is new; the address moves only after the old controller is gone.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 206" role="img" aria-labelledby="dcTitle dcDesc">
    <title id="dcTitle">Replacing a domain controller without converting it</title>
    <desc id="dcDesc">
      Four stages for the old and new domain controllers. In Build and Prove, the old DC stays
      online on its established IP while the new DC is promoted on a temporary IP and proves
      replication, SYSVOL, DNS and authentication. In Demote, the old DC is demoted and the new
      DC carries the site. In Reuse IP, the old DC is gone, its name is not reused, and the new
      DC takes the established IP and is validated again.
    </desc>

    <text class="panel-title" x="188" y="24" text-anchor="middle">BUILD</text>
    <text class="panel-title" x="336" y="24" text-anchor="middle">PROVE</text>
    <text class="panel-title" x="484" y="24" text-anchor="middle">DEMOTE</text>
    <text class="panel-title" x="632" y="24" text-anchor="middle">REUSE IP</text>

    <!-- Old DC lane -->
    <text class="label" x="16" y="70">Old DC</text>
    <text class="sub" x="16" y="88">VMware</text>
    <rect class="node" x="118" y="40" width="140" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="188" y="67" text-anchor="middle">Online</text>
    <text class="sub" x="188" y="85" text-anchor="middle">established IP</text>
    <rect class="node" x="266" y="40" width="140" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="336" y="67" text-anchor="middle">Online</text>
    <text class="sub" x="336" y="85" text-anchor="middle">established IP</text>
    <rect class="node" x="414" y="40" width="140" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="484" y="67" text-anchor="middle">Demoted</text>
    <text class="sub" x="484" y="85" text-anchor="middle">removal replicates</text>
    <rect class="panel" x="562" y="40" width="140" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="632" y="67" text-anchor="middle">Gone</text>
    <text class="sub" x="632" y="85" text-anchor="middle">name not reused</text>

    <!-- The established IP moves once the old DC has gone -->
    <path class="link-active" d="M484 102 L484 114 L632 114 L632 134" />
    <path class="link-active" d="M625 126 L632 134 L639 126" />

    <!-- New DC lane -->
    <text class="label" x="16" y="164">New DC</text>
    <text class="sub" x="16" y="182">Hyper-V</text>
    <rect class="node" x="118" y="134" width="140" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="188" y="161" text-anchor="middle">Promoted</text>
    <text class="sub" x="188" y="179" text-anchor="middle">new name, temp IP</text>
    <rect class="node" x="266" y="134" width="140" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="336" y="161" text-anchor="middle">Replicating</text>
    <text class="sub" x="336" y="179" text-anchor="middle">SYSVOL, DNS, auth</text>
    <rect class="node" x="414" y="134" width="140" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="484" y="161" text-anchor="middle">Carrying the site</text>
    <text class="sub" x="484" y="179" text-anchor="middle">still on temp IP</text>
    <rect class="node-edge" x="562" y="134" width="140" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="632" y="161" text-anchor="middle">Established IP</text>
    <text class="sub" x="632" y="179" text-anchor="middle">validate again</text>
  </svg>
</Diagram>
